{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">深水埗有唐樓單位閣樓冒煙，至少三人不適。<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發於大南街345號一棟唐樓，警方晚上近7時接報，指大廈閣樓有單位冒煙。現場消息指，一個劏房單位有電鑽電池起火，超過20人自行疏散，部分人逃至天台，需要消防架起雲梯協助。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.SSP-2200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Q1sVi5azhz1789311091.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FIRE.SSP-2200_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">部分住戶懷疑吸入濃煙不適，要由救護員協助。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T14:58:48.211307+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}